# BenchmarkDotNet
# Runs write to artifacts/<label>/. Keep the GitHub markdown reports so a v5
# baseline can be diffed against a v6 run in review; drop the logs, csv and html.
BenchmarkDotNet.Artifacts/
artifacts/**
!artifacts/**/
!artifacts/**/*-report-github.md

