# The Invulnerable Vagrant sample writes one SQLite file per bounded context beside
# the host: invulnerable-vagrant-catalog.db, invulnerable-vagrant-appraisal.db, and
# whatever the next context is called.
invulnerable-vagrant*.db
invulnerable-vagrant*.db-shm
invulnerable-vagrant*.db-wal
